    "termsOfUse": "Depending on the purpose of a new study, researchers may replicate research using the same dataset. Alternatively, similar research can be conducted using a comparable dataset, such as one from a different time period or involving other groups of general practitioners. Researchers are encouraged to contact the lead investigators at r.bakx@amsterdamumc.nl or RR.gorter@amsterdamumc.nl for further details.\n\nAccess to clinical data will be evaluated by the study team and the Trials Data Monitoring Committee. In accordance with applicable laws and regulations, the committee will review data access requests to ensure that data privacy and ethical standards are upheld.\n\nBefore utilizing the data, a Data Use Agreement will be drafted and must be signed in advance.\n\nCommercial institutions with no research objectives will not be granted access to the data.",
